---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About ${SITE_TITLE}`} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="site-shell">
			<Header />
			<main class="about-page">
				<p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> A little penguin, a very big sky</p>
				<h1>The story of<br /><span>Pip</span></h1>
				<p class="about-lead">
					Pip lives on a quiet island beneath a sky that seems to go on forever. One day, he found
					an orange cone, wore it as an explorer’s hat, and hopped onto a drifting iceberg.
				</p>
				<div class="about-story">
					<p>
						The iceberg bounced him higher than he expected. Since then, Pip has chased the next
						ledge through the clouds and beyond. Some platforms drift just out of reach; cracked
						ice makes him move quickly, while a well-timed fish can send him soaring.
					</p>
					<p>
						When a jump goes wrong, a rescue fish may appear—or the recovery arm may swoop in and
						carry him to safety. Every save gives Pip another chance to keep climbing toward the
						10,000-metre summit.
					</p>
					<p>
						Pip doesn’t know what waits at the top. He just loves finding out what’s beyond the
						next ledge.
					</p>
				</div>
				<a class="play-button about-play" href="/#play">Join Pip’s climb <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
			</main>
			<Footer />
		</div>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.about-page {
		width: min(760px, calc(100% - 56px));
		margin-inline: auto;
		padding: 76px 0 94px;
	}

	.about-page h1 {
		margin: 14px 0;
		font-size: clamp(50px, 7.2vw, 78px);
		letter-spacing: -4px;
		line-height: 0.98;
	}

	.about-page h1 span {
		color: #29969a;
	}

	.about-lead {
		max-width: 640px;
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 19px;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.about-story {
		margin: 38px 0 25px;
		padding: 24px;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 16px;
		background: var(--paper);
	}

	.about-story p {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}

	.about-story p + p {
		margin-top: 16px;
	}

	.about-play {
		width: fit-content;
	}

	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.about-page {
			width: calc(100% - 36px);
			padding: 50px 0 65px;
		}

		.about-page h1 {
			font-size: 54px;
			letter-spacing: -3px;
		}

		.about-lead {
			font-size: 17px;
		}

		.about-story {
			margin-top: 28px;
			padding: 18px;
		}

		.about-story p {
			font-size: 15px;
		}
	}
</style>
